1
00:00:22,799 --> 00:00:26,683
♪The night wind shakes off
the withered leaves♪

2
00:00:29,083 --> 00:00:33,698
♪I open the window and gaze at the moon♪

3
00:00:35,571 --> 00:00:40,709
♪Haze spreads across the river,
lanterns drifting♪

4
00:00:42,047 --> 00:00:47,056
♪I hear the memories rustling♪

5
00:00:48,267 --> 00:00:51,188
♪Garden flowers shed petals one by one♪

6
00:00:51,399 --> 00:00:54,490
♪Candlelight flickers,
swaying with melancholy♪

7
00:00:54,787 --> 00:00:59,022
♪I sigh by the lamp over the long night♪

8
00:01:01,007 --> 00:01:03,915
♪Past memories unfold scene by scene♪

9
00:01:04,213 --> 00:01:07,099
♪It's all your face♪

10
00:01:07,409 --> 00:01:12,191
♪Boldly trampling over my heart♪

11
00:01:12,191 --> 00:01:16,771
♪Two measures of ink I take,
one for love miswritten♪

12
00:01:16,771 --> 00:01:18,770
♪And another for youth passed♪

13
00:01:18,973 --> 00:01:24,755
♪With endless sorrow,
I once traced your silhouette♪

14
00:01:25,139 --> 00:01:29,450
♪Two measures of ink I take,
one for joy and sorrow♪

15
00:01:29,450 --> 00:01:31,958
♪And another for parting and reunion♪

16
00:01:32,204 --> 00:01:42,421
♪I write until splendor fades,
and I am no more♪

17
00:01:45,871 --> 00:01:48,705
=Prelude of the White Snake=

18
00:01:48,705 --> 00:01:51,623
=Episode 22=

19
00:01:53,000 --> 00:01:54,000
My lord,

20
00:01:54,000 --> 00:01:56,040
I just found out some crucial news.

21
00:01:59,480 --> 00:02:00,560
What is it?

22
00:02:01,319 --> 00:02:03,000
I just overheard outside
the Abbot's room

23
00:02:03,200 --> 00:02:05,640
that Jinshan Temple's Abbot
is the key to the seal.

24
00:02:05,760 --> 00:02:06,760
Once he dies,

25
00:02:06,760 --> 00:02:08,039
the seal will be lifted.

26
00:02:14,800 --> 00:02:17,120
Then why didn't you just kill him?

27
00:02:18,879 --> 00:02:21,120
There is a barrier in his room,

28
00:02:21,319 --> 00:02:22,319
so I couldn't kill him.

29
00:02:26,159 --> 00:02:27,159
Rise.

30
00:02:30,520 --> 00:02:32,159
I'll tell you what to do.

31
00:02:45,520 --> 00:02:46,520
I'm back.

32
00:02:48,800 --> 00:02:49,800
Where is everyone?

33
00:02:51,319 --> 00:02:52,840
Nobody's coming out to welcome me?

34
00:02:54,080 --> 00:02:55,080
Where is everyone?

35
00:02:57,520 --> 00:02:59,520
Why are you yelling
so early in the morning?

36
00:02:59,840 --> 00:03:01,639
So noisy! Keep quiet or get out.

37
00:03:02,560 --> 00:03:03,560
Get out?

38
00:03:09,719 --> 00:03:10,840
Why should I

39
00:03:10,840 --> 00:03:11,919
get out?

40
00:03:14,520 --> 00:03:16,479
I'm in. I'm out.

41
00:03:16,479 --> 00:03:18,400
I'm in. I'm out.

42
00:03:18,400 --> 00:03:19,479
I'm in.

43
00:03:19,800 --> 00:03:21,280
When did you invalidate the contract?

44
00:03:21,680 --> 00:03:24,360
As the head disciple of Jinshan Temple,

45
00:03:24,360 --> 00:03:25,719
how could I be bossed around?

46
00:03:26,360 --> 00:03:27,360
From now on,

47
00:03:28,360 --> 00:03:29,360
I'm a free man.

48
00:03:31,840 --> 00:03:33,000
A free man?

49
00:03:33,759 --> 00:03:35,120
By invalidating the contract,

50
00:03:35,120 --> 00:03:36,360
you think I can't boss you around?

51
00:03:36,840 --> 00:03:38,080
You, come here.

52
00:03:38,280 --> 00:03:39,280
I'm not coming over.

53
00:03:39,280 --> 00:03:40,280
I'm out.

54
00:03:40,280 --> 00:03:41,800
I'm out again. I'm out.

55
00:03:41,800 --> 00:03:43,080
- Come here!
- I'm out again.

56
00:03:43,080 --> 00:03:44,919
- Get over here!
- Come on, catch me.

57
00:03:44,919 --> 00:03:45,919
I'm not coming over.

58
00:03:45,919 --> 00:03:46,919
Come on.

59
00:03:47,400 --> 00:03:48,400
Get over here!

60
00:03:48,759 --> 00:03:50,039
Come on, come over here.

61
00:03:52,639 --> 00:03:53,639
Fahai!

62
00:03:54,280 --> 00:03:56,280
- I'm not coming over.
- Did you hear me?

63
00:03:56,439 --> 00:03:57,439
Come over here.

64
00:03:59,919 --> 00:04:00,919
No way!

65
00:04:01,400 --> 00:04:03,680
Fahai, how dare you!

66
00:04:08,240 --> 00:04:10,240
Don't! Not the face!

67
00:04:11,240 --> 00:04:12,520
I am so sorry, really!

68
00:04:14,360 --> 00:04:15,360
I won't do it again!

69
00:04:15,360 --> 00:04:16,360
Come over here!

70
00:04:17,360 --> 00:04:18,360
I'm sorry.

71
00:04:18,360 --> 00:04:19,639
I won't do it again! Stop it!

72
00:04:25,519 --> 00:04:27,439
That's the situation.

73
00:04:42,839 --> 00:04:44,720
Master told me to warn you two

74
00:04:45,279 --> 00:04:47,079
not to use spiritual powers
in the mortal realm.

75
00:04:47,720 --> 00:04:48,759
If his back acts up again,

76
00:04:52,399 --> 00:04:53,879
he'll come to catch you two.

77
00:04:55,079 --> 00:04:56,519
Can your master even catch me?

78
00:04:57,240 --> 00:04:58,399
Let me tell you,

79
00:04:58,399 --> 00:04:59,720
Master is very powerful.

80
00:05:03,319 --> 00:05:04,399
Master told me to ask you

81
00:05:04,920 --> 00:05:06,800
if the Drake Demon King
could be easily killed,

82
00:05:07,839 --> 00:05:09,959
why did Jinshan Temple
only suppress him?

83
00:05:11,120 --> 00:05:12,680
But if his true body

84
00:05:12,839 --> 00:05:14,360
is sealed in the Forbidden Area,

85
00:05:14,680 --> 00:05:17,519
then how could he control
my evil self to do his bidding?

86
00:05:22,680 --> 00:05:25,360
Right. How did he do that?

87
00:05:25,759 --> 00:05:28,319
Can anyone go
to that Forbidden Area at will?

88
00:05:28,319 --> 00:05:29,600
Of course not.

89
00:05:30,800 --> 00:05:32,399
Then how could your master not know?

90
00:05:37,680 --> 00:05:38,920
Come sit here.

91
00:05:39,240 --> 00:05:42,199
I shall impart the powers to you.

92
00:05:51,720 --> 00:05:52,839
That shouldn't be.

93
00:05:53,360 --> 00:05:54,360
What is wrong, Master?

94
00:05:56,040 --> 00:05:58,160
Perhaps the time hasn't come yet.

95
00:05:59,079 --> 00:06:00,600
Why are you keeping me in suspense?

96
00:06:00,600 --> 00:06:01,639
What's wrong?

97
00:06:02,360 --> 00:06:05,639
Fahai, though you're a bit clumsy,

98
00:06:05,959 --> 00:06:07,519
you are resilient.

99
00:06:08,199 --> 00:06:09,639
Though you're mischievous,

100
00:06:09,920 --> 00:06:11,399
you have great potential.

101
00:06:12,399 --> 00:06:14,639
Though sometimes
you can't tell good from evil,

102
00:06:15,040 --> 00:06:16,600
you are still

103
00:06:16,920 --> 00:06:18,800
my most pure-hearted disciple.

104
00:06:19,560 --> 00:06:20,560
Master,

105
00:06:21,879 --> 00:06:22,879
am I really that bad?

106
00:06:22,879 --> 00:06:25,399
Focus on the compliments I gave you.

107
00:06:28,639 --> 00:06:32,920
I only hope you can comprehend
the great Dao soon,

108
00:06:33,279 --> 00:06:35,240
achieve enlightenment in Buddhism,

109
00:06:35,959 --> 00:06:39,879
and protect the peace
of the people in my stead.

110
00:06:40,639 --> 00:06:42,040
Master, I can do it now.

111
00:06:42,040 --> 00:06:43,040
What did you...

112
00:06:47,319 --> 00:06:49,279
Amitabha.

113
00:06:50,560 --> 00:06:51,560
Go now.

114
00:06:52,360 --> 00:06:54,839
Remember, without my order,

115
00:06:55,199 --> 00:06:56,519
do not come back.

116
00:06:57,759 --> 00:06:58,759
But Master...

117
00:06:58,759 --> 00:06:59,759
Go.

118
00:07:00,639 --> 00:07:02,480
I am tired.

119
00:07:03,199 --> 00:07:04,839
Don't stay and disturb my meditation.

120
00:07:46,439 --> 00:07:48,680
Hey! What are you doing?

121
00:07:49,120 --> 00:07:50,160
Just go.

122
00:07:51,199 --> 00:07:52,199
Master, I'm leaving then.

123
00:07:57,360 --> 00:07:58,360
I'm leaving, Master.

124
00:08:03,040 --> 00:08:04,879
We should go to Jinshan Temple.

125
00:08:07,560 --> 00:08:09,079
But Master told me

126
00:08:09,079 --> 00:08:10,240
that without his order,

127
00:08:11,439 --> 00:08:12,720
I cannot go back.

128
00:08:13,519 --> 00:08:14,600
Think about it.

129
00:08:14,600 --> 00:08:16,399
Why did your master
impart the powers to you?

130
00:08:17,079 --> 00:08:18,839
He's always being so mysterious.

131
00:08:19,519 --> 00:08:21,839
He must have his reasons
for not letting me go back.

132
00:09:01,440 --> 00:09:02,440
Something's off with the seal.

133
00:09:02,519 --> 00:09:03,919
Everyone, take your artifacts.

134
00:09:03,919 --> 00:09:05,000
Go to the Forbidden Area!

135
00:09:05,120 --> 00:09:06,120
- Yes!
- Yes!

136
00:09:26,759 --> 00:09:27,799
Why does it light up?

137
00:09:37,200 --> 00:09:39,799
I-I don't know.

138
00:09:43,279 --> 00:09:44,279
An abnormal movement in Leifeng Pagoda.

139
00:09:44,600 --> 00:09:46,360
Did something go wrong with the seal?

140
00:09:46,960 --> 00:09:48,200
Abbot is the key to the seal.

141
00:09:49,320 --> 00:09:50,759
If something happens to the seal,

142
00:09:51,279 --> 00:09:52,320
Abbot will be in danger.

143
00:09:55,399 --> 00:09:56,679
Let's go and check.

144
00:10:00,559 --> 00:10:01,559
Let's go.

145
00:10:03,000 --> 00:10:04,559
Without my order,

146
00:10:05,159 --> 00:10:07,480
you can't come back.

147
00:10:07,679 --> 00:10:09,840
Why? Jinshan Temple is my home.

148
00:10:10,759 --> 00:10:15,279
I only hope you can comprehend
the great Dao soon,

149
00:10:15,519 --> 00:10:17,279
achieve enlightenment in Buddhism,

150
00:10:18,159 --> 00:10:21,879
and protect the peace
of the people in my stead.

151
00:10:22,919 --> 00:10:25,200
Remember, without my order,

152
00:10:25,480 --> 00:10:26,759
do not come back.

153
00:10:27,399 --> 00:10:28,399
But Master...

154
00:10:28,399 --> 00:10:29,399
Go.

155
00:10:30,480 --> 00:10:31,919
I am tired.

156
00:10:32,759 --> 00:10:33,759
Master!

157
00:11:02,600 --> 00:11:05,679
Old Monk, you came quite fast.

158
00:11:06,759 --> 00:11:09,360
You sealed me here
together for 300 years,

159
00:11:09,720 --> 00:11:11,840
making me suffer a lot.

160
00:11:12,720 --> 00:11:16,440
But today, I will break this seal

161
00:11:17,080 --> 00:11:20,799
and turn this world to ashes!

162
00:11:21,440 --> 00:11:22,639
Don't panic, everyone!

163
00:11:22,639 --> 00:11:24,120
Reinforce the seal with me!

164
00:11:24,399 --> 00:11:25,399
- Yes!
- Yes!

165
00:11:40,240 --> 00:11:42,720
I guard you here
by my late master's order

166
00:11:42,720 --> 00:11:43,840
to redeem you.

167
00:11:46,600 --> 00:11:47,679
Redeem me?

168
00:11:48,960 --> 00:11:51,080
When I was cultivating
in the mortal realm,

169
00:11:51,879 --> 00:11:53,799
you weren't even born yet.

170
00:11:54,360 --> 00:11:56,639
Who are you to redeem me?

171
00:11:57,360 --> 00:11:59,279
Though you've cultivated
for 1,000 years,

172
00:11:59,279 --> 00:12:00,759
you slaughtered living beings

173
00:12:00,759 --> 00:12:01,960
and devoured cores.

174
00:12:01,960 --> 00:12:04,480
You walk on a demonic path
paved with blood and bones.

175
00:12:04,480 --> 00:12:06,000
The Dao will never tolerate it!

176
00:12:06,799 --> 00:12:07,799
Dao?

177
00:12:08,799 --> 00:12:11,679
The Dao is nothing
but rules made by the strong.

178
00:12:12,360 --> 00:12:14,559
When I achieve supreme power,

179
00:12:15,120 --> 00:12:17,799
I shall be the Dao.

180
00:12:18,399 --> 00:12:19,399
By then,

181
00:12:19,519 --> 00:12:21,159
whoever I send to death

182
00:12:21,159 --> 00:12:22,559
will go to death.

183
00:12:22,559 --> 00:12:23,919
Whoever I grant ascension

184
00:12:24,200 --> 00:12:25,600
will ascend.

185
00:12:26,000 --> 00:12:27,000
Vile creature!

186
00:12:27,080 --> 00:12:28,480
Stubborn fool!

187
00:13:11,120 --> 00:13:12,720
Go down the mountain and tell Fahai

188
00:13:12,960 --> 00:13:14,799
not to come back to Jinshan Temple!

189
00:13:14,799 --> 00:13:16,559
- Master!
- Go now!

190
00:13:31,559 --> 00:13:33,960
Karma will come around.

191
00:13:35,080 --> 00:13:39,639
You will reap what you sow.

192
00:13:40,559 --> 00:13:44,000
Today, I'll show you
what the karma really is!

193
00:14:06,039 --> 00:14:07,039
Oh, no!

194
00:14:16,639 --> 00:14:19,000
My lord, congratulations
on breaking the seal!

195
00:14:22,080 --> 00:14:23,279
Break!

196
00:14:44,279 --> 00:14:46,879
Why?

197
00:14:50,279 --> 00:14:52,639
Didn't you say that once Abbot died,

198
00:14:53,440 --> 00:14:54,919
the seal would be lifted?

199
00:14:56,480 --> 00:14:58,840
I-I heard Abbot say

200
00:14:58,840 --> 00:15:00,200
that he's the key to the seal,

201
00:15:00,200 --> 00:15:02,000
and once he died, the seal would break.

202
00:15:02,919 --> 00:15:04,039
How could this happen?

203
00:15:20,919 --> 00:15:21,919
Mercy, My lord!

204
00:15:22,639 --> 00:15:24,639
I gathered demonic energy for you

205
00:15:24,879 --> 00:15:25,960
with utter loyalty.

206
00:15:26,320 --> 00:15:27,519
I never keep any for myself.

207
00:15:27,679 --> 00:15:28,879
Please trust me, My lord!

208
00:15:30,279 --> 00:15:32,200
Utter loyalty?

209
00:15:33,039 --> 00:15:35,600
You kept demonic energy for yourself.

210
00:15:36,000 --> 00:15:37,759
Do you really think I don't know that?

211
00:15:40,120 --> 00:15:42,279
My lord, I was wrong!

212
00:15:45,000 --> 00:15:46,480
Since you know you were wrong,

213
00:15:47,159 --> 00:15:51,039
use your life
to pave the way for my ascension.

214
00:15:51,039 --> 00:15:55,320
Use your body
to help me shatter this array.

215
00:16:02,080 --> 00:16:03,399
I only wanted to live.

216
00:16:03,840 --> 00:16:05,159
What did I do wrong?

217
00:16:57,068 --> 00:17:01,227
♪I also gave my youth to someone♪

218
00:17:03,694 --> 00:17:08,072
♪I must admit, you made the journey♪

219
00:17:09,615 --> 00:17:15,440
♪When loving you
became instinct, what's left♪

220
00:17:16,209 --> 00:17:20,676
♪Seals a fate too brutal to amend♪

221
00:17:23,541 --> 00:17:27,982
♪Clumsy and new, we gave our first kiss♪

222
00:17:30,178 --> 00:17:34,908
♪Never thought passionate eyes
would turn cold♪

223
00:17:36,120 --> 00:17:42,233
♪I thought of pulling away,
but I'd barely begun♪

224
00:17:42,896 --> 00:17:48,678
♪Having loved you so deep,
how could I love another♪

225
00:17:48,678 --> 00:17:54,941
♪Even if we're strangers again,
why deny we loved♪

226
00:17:55,251 --> 00:18:01,610
♪Though I'm stubborn,
I never stopped you from loving others♪

227
00:18:01,781 --> 00:18:09,148
♪I shouldn't have been so foolish
to think there was still hope♪

228
00:18:09,433 --> 00:18:14,980
♪But you won't even admit what we had♪

229
00:18:15,471 --> 00:18:21,681
♪Even if we're strangers again,
why deny we loved♪

230
00:18:21,991 --> 00:18:28,764
♪Though I have questions,
I never questioned you♪

231
00:18:29,761 --> 00:18:35,414
♪I'll lock you away and set myself free♪

232
00:18:36,248 --> 00:18:40,656
♪After all, I'm the one you deny♪

233
00:18:41,421 --> 00:18:44,009
♪Having ever loved♪
